---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Brandon's Portfolio"
  description="Learn about Brandon's background, skills, and creative approach."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-lg">
          Brandon is a digital illustrator based in the Pacific Northwest. His
          work bridges technical precision and expressive storytelling, drawing
          on a background in both traditional fine arts and contemporary design.
        </p>
        <p>
          With over a decade of experience working with clients across editorial
          publishing, brand identity, and interactive media, Brandon brings a
          meticulous eye for composition and color to every project. He is
          equally comfortable executing tight creative briefs and developing
          original visual concepts from scratch.
        </p>
        <p>
          Brandon's approach emphasizes clarity, intention, and atmosphere. He
          believes that the best illustrations don't just depict a subject
          &mdash; they make the viewer feel something. Whether it's a
          high-energy editorial piece or a subdued portrait study, every image
          is built around a strong emotional core.
        </p>
        <p>
          When not at the drawing tablet, Brandon can be found hiking Pacific
          Northwest trails, collecting mid-century design books, or sketching in
          coffee shops.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 pt-4">
          Skills &amp; Tools
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Illustration
            </h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
              <li>Digital painting</li>
              <li>Vector illustration</li>
              <li>Character design</li>
              <li>Environment &amp; background art</li>
              <li>Typography &amp; hand-lettering</li>
              <li>Storyboarding</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Tools
            </h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
              <li>Procreate</li>
              <li>Adobe Photoshop</li>
              <li>Adobe Illustrator</li>
              <li>Blender</li>
              <li>Figma</li>
              <li>Clip Studio Paint</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Design
            </h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
              <li>Brand identity</li>
              <li>Color theory</li>
              <li>Layout &amp; composition</li>
              <li>Editorial design</li>
              <li>Art direction</li>
              <li>Creative strategy</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
              Soft Skills
            </h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
              <li>Client communication</li>
              <li>Project scoping</li>
              <li>Iterative feedback</li>
              <li>Deadline management</li>
              <li>Cross-team collaboration</li>
              <li>Mentorship</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="lg:col-span-1">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden"
          style="aspect-ratio: 3/4; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f0f0 0%, #e0e0e0 50%, #d0d0d0 100%);"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-full text-gray-400">
            <div class="text-center">
              <svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                width="48"
                height="48"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="mx-auto"
                role="img"
                aria-label="Self-portrait placeholder"
              >
                <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4" />
              </svg>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">Self-portrait placeholder</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
